            <li>1 Port Remote MikroTik</li><li>3 Port Forward</li><li>Remote via WinBox/Webfig/MikroTik App</li><li>Tunnel untuk MikroTik API</li><li>Ganti nama ISP pada speed test</li><li>Gratis Konfigurasi</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://wa.me/6282324129752?text=Saya%20ingin%20berlangganan%20VPN%20Remote%20bulanan%20P1" class="btn btn-primary mt-6 w-full">BUY NOW</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">P2</h3>
          <p class="mt-2"><span class="text-4xl font-extrabold">Rp 100K</span> <span class="text-slate-500">/tahun</span></p>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <li>1 Router MikroTik</li><li>3 Port Forward</li><li>Remote via WinBox/Webfig/MikroTik App</li><li>Tunnel untuk MikroTik API</li><li>Ganti nama ISP pada speed test</li><li>Gratis Konfigurasi</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="https://wa.me/6282324129752?text=Saya%20ingin%20berlangganan%20VPN%20Remote%20tahunan%20P2" class="btn bg-slate-900 text-white hover:bg-slate-800 mt-6 w-full">BUY NOW</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-narrow py-12">
    <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      <details class="rounded-xl border p-4 open:bg-slate-50"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold">Bagaimana cara mengakses router di luar jaringan dengan layanan VPN Remote?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Gunakan WinBox, MikroTik App, atau browser (Webfig) melalui tunnel yang diberikan.</p></details>
      <details class="rounded-xl border p-4 open:bg-slate-50"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold">Apakah bisa untuk remote perangkat lain di belakang MikroTik?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Ya, gunakan fitur port forward (3 port) untuk access point, router, web server.</p></details>
      <details class="rounded-xl border p-4 open:bg-slate-50"><summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold">Apakah VPN Remote aman?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Ya, menggunakan protokol terenkripsi.</p></details>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">Ada pertanyaan lain? <a href="https://wa.me/6282324129752?text=Saya%20ingin%20bertanya%20tentang%20VPN%20Remote" class="text-primary underline">Hubungi Kami</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
